  "notable_quotes": [
    "The framework can be produced at scale: 1·G microcrystals were made in a 30-L vessel, affording 124 g product at about 86% yield.",
    "Breakthrough tests showed unchanged separation performance over 298-353 K and no degradation over multiple adsorption-desorption cycles at 353 K.",
    "Previously reported room-temperature sieving MOFs show ultrahigh selectivity, but their practical use is limited by sluggish adsorption kinetics."
